[{:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-102477"] :question/problem "Find ${f}^{″}(1,2)$ for the function $f(x,y)$ given that\n${f}^{′}(x,y)=[\\begin{aligned}y-2xy & x-{x}^{2}\\end{aligned}]$" :question/worked-solution "For a function $f:{R}^{n}\\to R,$ given by\n\n$$\nf:{{[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ ⋮ \\\\ {x}_{n}\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{x}⟶f({x}_{1},{x}_{2},…,{x}_{n}),\n$$\n\nthe second derivative of $f$ is given by the $n\\times n$ matrix\n\n$$\n{f}^{″}(x)=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{1}^{2}} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{1}∂{x}_{2}} & ⋯ & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{1}∂{x}_{n}} \\\\ \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{2}∂{x}_{1}} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{2}^{2}} & ⋯ & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{2}∂{x}_{n}} \\\\ ⋮ & ⋮ & ⋮ & ⋮ \\\\ \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{n}∂{x}_{1}} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{n}∂{x}_{2}} & ⋯ & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{n}^{2}}\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nIn our case, we have\n\n$$\n{f}^{″}(x,y)=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}^{2}} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂x∂y} \\\\ \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂y∂x} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{y}^{2}}\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nFirst, notice that since ${f}^{′}(x,y)=[\\begin{aligned}y-2xy & x-{x}^{2}\\end{aligned}],$ \n we must have\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂f}{∂x}=y-2xy,\\,\\frac{∂f}{∂y}=x-{x}^{2}.\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the second partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}^{2}} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(y-2xy)=-2y\\, & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂x∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(x-{x}^{2})=1-2x \\\\ \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂y∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(y-2xy)=1-2x\\, & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{y}^{2}} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(x-{x}^{2})=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the second derivative is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{″}(x,y) & =[\\begin{aligned}-2y & 1-2x \\\\ 1-2x & 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate this matrix at $(1,2).$ This gives\n\n$$\n{f}^{″}(1,2)=[\\begin{aligned}-4 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-163637/selection/926334fd90f428c3b7e122b8b36f8505627a32038d3d41bc273837f32e8256e8" :answer/id #uuid "28822fbd-5c58-5060-88c5-88e697415346" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}5 & 20 \\\\ 20 & -2\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-163637/selection/d61fb3a462d2846b9b2e0aaf7bf36a61aefaf44fae661c742625a07b4c335e0f" :answer/id #uuid "983d88c0-d87c-5dd3-a41c-72fdaaf93edf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}10 & 5 \\\\ 5 & -2\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-163637/selection/0be71ff2a49bba2310978c4177d8dbfc8579382cb2fb73ffb5bc70507c3bcd59" :answer/id #uuid "50f86f66-ae94-5851-ba33-ab57d53ee22e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}20 & -5 \\\\ -5 & -2\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-163637/selection/bc88a21df2066cd97da0a13b5ca70d3b9962941ac1884642a221b587ec2f4626" :answer/id #uuid "5b5fcded-c5b9-5534-b96b-d771d791e7b0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}5 & 10 \\\\ 10 & -2\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-163637/selection/e5993f5f83761c95d2ed2d0ebad9efe4e879ba3c7f8c4d581dbd777d8bd9f39d" :answer/id #uuid "9232dbae-a74a-5820-a223-5cd2a6873852" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}5 & 5 \\\\ 5 & -2\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-163637/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "0ef2bc12-5fc1-5ae0-b2f4-298237b52419" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-163637/selection/e5993f5f83761c95d2ed2d0ebad9efe4e879ba3c7f8c4d581dbd777d8bd9f39d" :answer-field/choices ["q-163637/selection/926334fd90f428c3b7e122b8b36f8505627a32038d3d41bc273837f32e8256e8" "q-163637/selection/d61fb3a462d2846b9b2e0aaf7bf36a61aefaf44fae661c742625a07b4c335e0f" "q-163637/selection/0be71ff2a49bba2310978c4177d8dbfc8579382cb2fb73ffb5bc70507c3bcd59" "q-163637/selection/bc88a21df2066cd97da0a13b5ca70d3b9962941ac1884642a221b587ec2f4626" "q-163637/selection/e5993f5f83761c95d2ed2d0ebad9efe4e879ba3c7f8c4d581dbd777d8bd9f39d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-163637" :question/id #uuid "80f3f97d-e5ae-5fea-a537-3ca9f7c75a2e" :question/math-academy-id "q-163637" :question/problem "Find ${f}^{″}(\\frac{1}{2},\\frac{1}{2})$ for the function $f(x,y)$ given that\n${f}^{′}(x,y)=[\\begin{aligned}10xy & 5{x}^{2}-2y\\end{aligned}]$" :question/worked-solution "For a function $f:{R}^{n}\\to R,$ given by\n\n$$\nf:{{[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ ⋮ \\\\ {x}_{n}\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{x}⟶f({x}_{1},{x}_{2},…,{x}_{n}),\n$$\n\nthe second derivative of $f$ is given by the $n\\times n$ matrix\n\n$$\n{f}^{″}(x)=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{1}^{2}} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{1}∂{x}_{2}} & ⋯ & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{1}∂{x}_{n}} \\\\ \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{2}∂{x}_{1}} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{2}^{2}} & ⋯ & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{2}∂{x}_{n}} \\\\ ⋮ & ⋮ & ⋮ & ⋮ \\\\ \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{n}∂{x}_{1}} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{n}∂{x}_{2}} & ⋯ & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{n}^{2}}\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nIn our case, we have\n\n$$\n{f}^{″}(x,y)=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}^{2}} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂x∂y} \\\\ \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂y∂x} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{y}^{2}}\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nFirst, notice that since ${f}^{′}(x,y)=[\\begin{aligned}10xy & 5{x}^{2}-2y\\end{aligned}],$ \n we must have\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂f}{∂x}=10xy,\\,\\frac{∂f}{∂y}=5{x}^{2}-2y.\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the second partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}^{2}} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(10xy)=10y\\, & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂x∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(5{x}^{2}-2y)=10x \\\\ \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂y∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(10xy)=10x\\, & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{y}^{2}} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(5{x}^{2}-2y)=-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the second derivative is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{″}(x,y) & =[\\begin{aligned}10y & 10x \\\\ 10x & -2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate this matrix at $(\\frac{1}{2},\\frac{1}{2}).$ This gives\n\n$$\n{f}^{″}(\\frac{1}{2},\\frac{1}{2})=[\\begin{aligned}5 & 5 \\\\ 5 & -2\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-163637/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "74c4234a-3aa1-5b6b-b68b-48e6aa2b0dfb"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-163637"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-81110/selection/a70a4329fbddf680bf5c6703f9120f399d56fb8f0ba4400387b53b0785ce2945" :answer/id #uuid "6507c299-b466-526d-8287-f326a5e34d31" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}{e}^{2-x} & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81110/selection/789dcea4cc1faeaecd0c65a23c47c2009495f36b969af0279c7f9859785c9af7" :answer/id #uuid "d00818d0-c5f2-5c89-a9a6-85860160f7c6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-{e}^{2-x} & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81110/selection/a60d3384de757b2ee585edd78186eb4e061438fd30ddefac2ce10bac0419d621" :answer/id #uuid "b9c1ff1a-fedc-53bf-9bcd-d3bf24fff1d3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}{e}^{-x} & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81110/selection/f8a6aa70f2f0fe95c3d64790e87ea5409efce9017583e4f672fa371d03dd2674" :answer/id #uuid "fc8525c8-6d4c-51d5-b2d2-7572e1c44dc6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}e & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81110/selection/633c7e15c00e83ec77ebb6db68b8487015ff1cb1039ddb7462948012cd5e4f11" :answer/id #uuid "f87e09d9-b96e-57a2-a46b-0b86ee7e6c87" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-{e}^{2} & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81110/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "d0f2cb1a-ba6b-54f6-bade-4fd1d5107acf" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-81110/selection/a70a4329fbddf680bf5c6703f9120f399d56fb8f0ba4400387b53b0785ce2945" :answer-field/choices ["q-81110/selection/a70a4329fbddf680bf5c6703f9120f399d56fb8f0ba4400387b53b0785ce2945" "q-81110/selection/789dcea4cc1faeaecd0c65a23c47c2009495f36b969af0279c7f9859785c9af7" "q-81110/selection/a60d3384de757b2ee585edd78186eb4e061438fd30ddefac2ce10bac0419d621" "q-81110/selection/f8a6aa70f2f0fe95c3d64790e87ea5409efce9017583e4f672fa371d03dd2674" "q-81110/selection/633c7e15c00e83ec77ebb6db68b8487015ff1cb1039ddb7462948012cd5e4f11"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-81110" :question/id #uuid "4c1140cc-a082-5c3a-9371-31aefe906ee9" :question/math-academy-id "q-81110" :question/problem "Find ${f}^{″}(x,y)$ for the function $f(x,y)$ given that\n${f}^{′}(x,y)=[\\begin{aligned}e-{e}^{2-x} & 2y\\end{aligned}]$" :question/worked-solution "For a function $f:{R}^{n}\\to R,$ given by\n\n$$\nf:{{[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ ⋮ \\\\ {x}_{n}\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{x}⟶f({x}_{1},{x}_{2},…,{x}_{n}),\n$$\n\nthe second derivative of $f$ is given by the $n\\times n$ matrix\n\n$$\n{f}^{″}(x)=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{1}^{2}} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{1}∂{x}_{2}} & ⋯ & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{1}∂{x}_{n}} \\\\ \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{2}∂{x}_{1}} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{2}^{2}} & ⋯ & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{2}∂{x}_{n}} \\\\ ⋮ & ⋮ & ⋮ & ⋮ \\\\ \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{n}∂{x}_{1}} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{n}∂{x}_{2}} & ⋯ & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{n}^{2}}\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nIn our case, we have\n\n$$\n{f}^{″}(x,y)=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}^{2}} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂x∂y} \\\\ \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂y∂x} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{y}^{2}}\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nFirst, notice that since ${f}^{′}(x,y)=[\\begin{aligned}e-{e}^{2-x} & 2y\\end{aligned}],$ we must have\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂f}{∂x}=e-{e}^{2-x},\\,\\frac{∂f}{∂y}=2y.\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the second partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}^{2}} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(e-{e}^{2-x})={e}^{2-x}\\, & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂x∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(2y)=0 \\\\ \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂y∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(e-{e}^{2-x})=0\\, & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{y}^{2}} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(2y)=2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the second derivative is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{″}(x,y) & =[\\begin{aligned}{e}^{2-x} & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-81110/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "74c4234a-3aa1-5b6b-b68b-48e6aa2b0dfb"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-81110"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-81009/selection/f7ab3170e71f78eb480226a5f177e391717ac71797a07cb72e8b6997de04e577" :answer/id #uuid "1213a6a8-21a5-5951-ac7b-333113736301" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2x & 6 \\\\ 6 & 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81009/selection/a6107dc0c66b371f98939d39ff818c153971abd606530df9f4e20eecf13f0a1f" :answer/id #uuid "113be9ea-8239-5063-9d52-c790cdd779f9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-2y & 4x \\\\ 4x & 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81009/selection/2993b9506605d68fa98853a1dbbc89fc33669753d49001e07252d81968364e87" :answer/id #uuid "7ce9f13c-d9d3-59ec-b2e3-7b6d7f7cff56" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}0 & -4 \\\\ -4 & 6y\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81009/selection/f5ffb6cd4d7bca1216bdd15776ce873377a95630b7b19ed0f52016ea2ee94fd9" :answer/id #uuid "c7f47f8e-bdf6-582e-920b-c709d06a8bbc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}6y & 4x \\\\ 4x & 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81009/selection/a3660b37d74c26145ab30298b15f3987977d7cc72cb6311c150ba8ef0d1bbe23" :answer/id #uuid "6d0fde94-e7ae-5f10-ae5f-c18dcd5baf62" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}0 & 4x \\\\ 4x & -4y\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81009/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "