1.\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the second partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}^{2}} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(-4y+1)=0\\, & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂x∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(3{y}^{2}-4x-1)=-4 \\\\ \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂y∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(-4y+1)=-4\\, & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{y}^{2}} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(3{y}^{2}-4x-1)=6y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the second derivative is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{″}(x,y) & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & -4 \\\\ -4 & 6y\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-81009/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "74c4234a-3aa1-5b6b-b68b-48e6aa2b0dfb"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-81009"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-163635/selection/01c649f3795e55ebaf4d07ef3db5f14030f2dde5e95d4ea2b3e0d31d79bd0f36" :answer/id #uuid "d83017a8-d7a0-5257-b688-8e0e64ba9fa5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}0 & -2 \\\\ -2 & 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-163635/selection/e5f8f0fe01fcb90c2adc82baf1b9d892154934cf5d4947bcab00d3000cd184c4" :answer/id #uuid "b194eb44-7cd0-5bd3-9250-1f32b2777399" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-163635/selection/5b11164977782e22d65a7f25739b8988ba316c6c11a1d3befd90d66558c173ad" :answer/id #uuid "cca141ca-493d-5423-b6c7-3670a4139cf2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{2} & 2 \\\\ 2 & -2\\sqrt{2}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-163635/selection/f0e51cbf0a2d3f0623e4990204f1fedc6c71550c469ca8670d699d2cb2e1ce74" :answer/id #uuid "76fbf3c6-4c4d-5502-bafd-69c9184cc1f0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -4\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-163635/selection/40daf880bd86f828d9b5c49d12fbebcabb6b9682bdebd44e69e751843ead7e8e" :answer/id #uuid 